I think the problem is that your datafile has no (and hence, default)
variable names. Are you using the names 'V1', 'V2', etc in your model
syntax? If you have different variable names in your model syntax, you
need to rename the variables in ex115 first, using something like

names(ex115) <- c("item1", "item2", "item3", ...)

where your replace "item1" etc by the names you need.

Yves.

