> made by you, I am unable to get VarCov matrix with homogeneous Var and
> Cov.  Am I doing something wrong?

Yes:

>          Neuro1 ~~ 1*Neuro1
>          Neuro2 ~~ 1*Neuro2
>          Neuro3 ~~ 1*Neuro3
>          Neuro4 ~~ 1*Neuro4
>          Neuro5 ~~ 1*Neuro5
>          Neuro6 ~~ 1*Neuro6

should be:

Neuro1 ~~ v1*Neuro1
Neuro2 ~~ v1*Neuro2
Neuro3 ~~ v1*Neuro3
Neuro4 ~~ v1*Neuro4
Neuro5 ~~ v1*Neuro5
Neuro6 ~~ v1*Neuro6

where the 'v1' is a label. It could be any string starting with a character.

Yves.

